<title>ISRAEL: IDB Holding Q1 net up.</title>
<headline>IDB Holding Q1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>IDB Holding Corp reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels except per share)</p>
<p>			   Q1 97	Q1 96</p>
<p>Revenue		  474,726    449,197</p>
<p>Pretax profit	  146,297    127,862</p>
<p>Net profit		45,900     43,242</p>
<p>Earnings per share     1.21	 1.15</p>
<p>($1=3.395 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
